OL,3,GNEWSAWoman in 80s suffers
OL,4,Alife-threatening burns in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 80s has suffered
OL,7,Flife-threatening burns in a fire at a
OL,8,Fhouse in Bradford.
OL,10,FThe incident happened shortly before
OL,11,F13:15 BST on Sunday, at an address on
OL,12,FWoodlands Street, West Yorkshire Police
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FOfficers said the fire was not
OL,16,Fcurrently being treated as suspicious.
OL,18,FWest Yorkshire Fire & Rescue Service
OL,19,Fsaid it sent two crews to the scene and
OL,20,Fthat it would be investigating the
OL,21,Fcause of the blaze alongside police.
